    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d199">

                <pb facs="0523" n="409" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg409"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/30634</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Assistant to the President’s Military Aide</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hammond</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Assistant
                        Chief of the Division of European Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hickerson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-08-09">August 9, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for Mr. Hickerson</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The following message from the President was received in the White House Map Room
                    during the night: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Proposed Canadian release is approved as to text and procedure.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <pb facs="0524" n="410" xml:id="pg410"/>
                <p>The duty officer in the office of the Secretary of State was notified August 8th
                    at 2330.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d199-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chester Hammond</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Lt. Colonel, General Staff</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Asst. to the Military Aide</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d199-f1" n="1" xml:id="d199-f1-content">
                <p>i.e., 11:30 p.m. This memorandum bears the following manuscript endorsement by
                    Hickerson: “Telephoned to Mr. Atherton, Am. Legation, Ottawa 9:45 a.m. Aug. 9
                    J[ohn] D H[iekerson]”.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
